WEBVTT

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.330
forced us to move
to Somali's capital, Mogadishu.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.350
When I was 18,

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:37.390
my father realized
Somalia was headed for a civil war

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.053
and we are all at risk of being killed.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.390
He did his best

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:46.690
to get me and my 13 brothers
and sisters out of the country.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.160
The family was scattered to the wind.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.860
I was lucky.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:56.470
I ended up on my own
as a displaced person in Kenya,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.010
and I was fortunate to come to Australia